git rm -r --cached node_modules
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "Remove node_modules from tracking"
git push
```

The `--cached` flag removes it from git only — it won't delete the folder from your computer.

---

**Full recommended `.gitignore` for Node.js projects:**
```
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.DS_Store
*.log
config.bat
